== Effects ==
* On use, summons {{E|Baby Plum}} to fight for Isaac in the current room for roughly 10 seconds.
** Baby Plum will always twirl, jump, then spit blood and bounce around the room before waving goodbye and flying away.
** Baby Plum does 12 contact damage per tick (24 per second), 3.5 damage per shot, and 2 damage per tick with creep (20 per second).
* {{transformation contribution|Beelzebub}}

== Notes ==
* If Isaac goes enough time (about half a minute) without hurting {{E|Baby Plum}} during a boss fight, she will fly away and leave behind a Plum Flute on the Boss Room pedestal.
** Damage done with {{I|Suplex!}} does not count as hurting Baby Plum.
** Damage done indirectly, like losing {{e|Black Heart}}s, does not count as hurting Baby Plum.
** Damage dealt passively by [[familiar]]s such as {{i|Demon Baby}}, {{i|Succubus}}, and {{i|Psy Fly}} does count as hurting Baby Plum.

== Synergies ==
* {{I|Angelic Prism}}: {{E|Baby Plum}}'s shots that pass through the Prism will be split into four.
* {{Book of Virtues synergy|description=Spawns a wisp on the middle ring, resembling Baby Plum. When the {{E|Baby Plum}} spawned from using Plum Flute bounces diagonally around the room, all the wisps will bounce around the room and fire tears behind themselves as well. The wisps are invulnerable while bouncing around the room.}}
* {{I|BFFS!}} / {{I|Hive Mind}}: Doubles {{E|Baby Plum}}'s contact damage, but not projectile damage. Plum is also larger.
* {{I|Car Battery}}: Summons two Baby Plums, the Baby Plums start out overlapped but can sometimes split up when using different attacks.
* {{T|Lost Cork}}: Affects Baby Plum's blood puddle.
* {{I|Sacrificial Altar}}: Baby Plum can be sacrificed for free, instead of a familiar. Plum Flute can still be used as normal afterwards.

== Interactions ==
* {{T|Baby-Bender}}: No effect.
* {{I|Eraser}}: Plum Flute will still function normally if the boss Baby Plum is erased.

